        </div>
        <div class="msv__faq-item">
          <div class="msv__faq-q">What happens if I exceed the 20-hour limit?</div>
          <div class="msv__faq-a">Working beyond the permitted hours can be grounds for visa revocation. Your university may also take disciplinary action. Spain&#x27;s immigration authorities monitor compliance, especially if reported by employers or your institution.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="msv__faq-item">
          <div class="msv__faq-q">Can I work for an online company outside of Spain?</div>
          <div class="msv__faq-a">Technically yes, but only if it&#x27;s self-employment through a registered Spanish business structure. Remote work for foreign companies without proper Spanish registration is not permitted and can lead to visa issues.</div>
